  "ruleText": "Phy 307.01 Physical Therapy Compact. The board shall comply with all rules of the Physical Therapy Compact Commission, which includes the “Physical Therapy Compact Commission Rules”, effective June 17, 2024, and available as noted in Appendix II.\n\nSource. #12696, eff 12-27-18; ss by #14563, eff 6-20-26, EXPIRES: 6-20-36 (formerly Phy 308.01)",
